===Kwangju Empire===
{{Main|Kwangju Empire|Plum Blossom Reformation}}
[[File:Sunjong of the Korean Empire.jpg|left|thumb|357x357px|Emperor Wŏnsingi]]
The [[Three Kingdoms Period]] of Kwangju's history ended with the declaration of the [[Kwangju Empire]] at [[Geunchogo-Baekje Palace]] in Jinju, by [[Emperor Wŏnsingi]] in 1902. Wŏnsingi oversaw the modernization of Kwangju's military, industry, and education system, while also lobbying for increased international recognition in an attempt to discourage increasing aggression from Mitoyagi. Sanese interference and aggression against Kwangju continue to intensify despite efforts by Emperor Wonsingi, and he was eventually assassinated by a pro-Sanese agitator in 1908.
