===Ethnic groups===
The largest ethnic group in the country is Kwangju, who make up about 85% of the population, making Kwangju one of the more homogeneous countries in the world. The second largest ethnic group are Sanese, who make up 10% of the population, some of who stayed in Kwangju following the end of the Great Adonian War, but most are immigrants who have moved from Sanese countries such as Okaiken.

The proportional of foreign born citizens has steadily grown, as a result of both external migration to Kwangju, and the continued decline of the national birthrate. There is a small community of Andalusians living in isolated areas of the country, most of them descendants of soldiers that fought in Kwangju during the Great War. 
